{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53693","headline":"永嘉百咏 周公庙 · 张又新","name":"永嘉百咏 周公庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祠像已加唐衮冕，乐工犹服晋衣冠。\n（见光绪《永嘉县志》卷四「横山周公庙」条）（按：《百里芳》、《周公庙》二题，承张靖龙同志录示。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张又新","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53693.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53693","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}